WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.357
Unit eleven. Dengue and Malaria!

2
00:00:04.308 --> 00:00:07.792
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.842 --> 00:00:11.388
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.438 --> 00:00:15.298
Today we learn about Dengue and Malaria. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.275 --> 00:00:19.708
Dengue. Say it with me. Dengue!

6
00:00:23.207 --> 00:00:26.840
Malaria. Say it with me. Malaria!

7
00:00:30.342 --> 00:00:34.242
Mosquito. Say it with me. Mosquito!

8
00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:40.873
Fever. Say it with me. Fever!

9
00:00:44.397 --> 00:00:47.664
Net. Say it with me. Net!

10
00:00:51.163 --> 00:00:54.829
Repellent. Say it with me. Repellent!

11
00:00:58.326 --> 00:01:02.393
Standing water. Say it with me. Standing water!

12
00:01:05.889 --> 00:01:09.239
Clinic. Say it with me. Clinic!

13
00:01:12.754 --> 00:01:22.124
Dengue and malaria are spread by mosquito bites and cause fever. We sleep under a net, use repellent, and remove standing water. Anyone with a high fever should go to a clinic.

14
00:01:22.174 --> 00:01:23.324
I can do that too!

15
00:01:25.078 --> 00:01:30.170
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:31.370
Mosquito!

17
00:01:32.398 --> 00:01:37.619
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.669 --> 00:01:38.975
Standing water!

19
00:01:39.917 --> 00:01:47.354
Did you know? Different mosquitoes spread dengue and malaria — the dengue mosquito often bites in the daytime!

20
00:01:47.404 --> 00:01:49.472
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:50.214 --> 00:01:59.270
Think and answer. Why should people with a high fever see a health worker quickly?

22
00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:00.470
Great answer!

23
00:02:01.689 --> 00:02:06.383
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:06.433 --> 00:02:08.964
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

